                                                "sense_id": "c8356a58-b99e-3b1d-80a4-a6626629bdf9",
                                                "text": "I don't value Monſieur de Champignon a rotten potatoe; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6f9d90e-b65f-39b7-bfcf-58d27070a22b",
